1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,294
听：A Hard Trip.

2
00:00:01,294 --> 00:00:02,589
跟读：A Hard Trip.

3
00:00:02,589 --> 00:00:21,855
听：My sister was fond of traveling. Ever since graduating, she had been determined to organize a trip to an old temple. Since the transport fare was expensive, she decided to use a bicycle to cycle there not caring about the disadvantages.

4
00:00:21,855 --> 00:00:41,121
跟读：My sister was fond of traveling. Ever since graduating, she had been determined to organize a trip to an old temple. Since the transport fare was expensive, she decided to use a bicycle to cycle there not caring about the disadvantages.

5
00:00:41,121 --> 00:00:57,167
听：Her stubborn attitude was always her shortcoming. Once she made up her mind to do something, no one could persuade her to change her mind. Finally, we gave in as usual though we preferred to take a train.

6
00:00:57,167 --> 00:01:13,213
跟读：Her stubborn attitude was always her shortcoming. Once she made up her mind to do something, no one could persuade her to change her mind. Finally, we gave in as usual though we preferred to take a train.

7
00:01:13,213 --> 00:01:36,424
听：After we prepared everything, including the schedule, reliable weather forecast and the insurance, we began our trip. Our journey was along a river flowing from a high altitude. Our pace was slow because the river frequently had many sharp bends through deep valleys, where the water seemed to boil.

8
00:01:36,424 --> 00:01:59,636
跟读：After we prepared everything, including the schedule, reliable weather forecast and the insurance, we began our trip. Our journey was along a river flowing from a high altitude. Our pace was slow because the river frequently had many sharp bends through deep valleys, where the water seemed to boil.

9
00:01:59,636 --> 00:02:15,435
听：Just as I recorded in my journal, it was really a hard journey. But we also enjoyed great views. One night, I put my head on my pillow--a parcel of wool coats, and lay beneath the stars.

10
00:02:15,435 --> 00:02:31,233
跟读：Just as I recorded in my journal, it was really a hard journey. But we also enjoyed great views. One night, I put my head on my pillow--a parcel of wool coats, and lay beneath the stars.

11
00:02:31,233 --> 00:02:37,723
听：When the flame in front of our cave went out at midnight, I found the sky so beautiful!

12
00:02:37,723 --> 00:02:44,212
跟读：When the flame in front of our cave went out at midnight, I found the sky so beautiful!
